{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 17, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was a dream come true. As soon as I stepped off the plane, I was struck by the unique blend of traditional and modern culture that permeates every aspect of Japanese society. From the bustling streets of Tokyo to the serene gardens of Kyoto, I was constantly amazed by the beauty and complexity of this fascinating country.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was visiting the famous Tsukiji Fish Market in Tokyo. The sights and smells of the market were overwhelming, with fresh sushi and seafood on display everywhere. I was also impressed by the efficiency and politeness of the Japanese people, who went about their daily business with a quiet courtesy that was inspiring to see.\n\nIn Kyoto, I spent hours exploring the city's many temples and gardens, marveling at the intricate carvings and beautiful gardens that seemed to be around every corner. The peaceful atmosphere of the temples was a welcome respite from the hustle and bustle of city life, and I felt a deep sense of calm and tranquility as I wandered through the serene landscapes.\n\nOverall, my trip to Japan was an unforgettable experience that left me with a deep appreciation for this unique and captivating culture. I was struck by the country's rich history, vibrant cities, and stunning natural beauty, and I can't wait to return and explore more of what Japan has to offer.", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.4731934368610382}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.0053151012398302555}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -7.867782187531702e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -6.556489552167477e-06}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.25465595722198486}, {"token": " dream", "logprob": -2.3177647590637207}, {"token": " come", "logprob": -6.198863957251888e-06}, {"token": " true"